### 1. AUTHENTICATION (Bina token ke chalenge)
### ========================================

### 1A. Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "rkbansal",
    "email": "rohitbansal.dev@gmail.com",
    "password": "rkb@2005",
    "role": "Admin" 
}

###

### 1B. Login User (Token copy karke upar @token me dalna)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "rohitbansal.dev@gmail.com",
    "password": "rkb@2005"
}

###

### 1C. Get Current Logged In User
